5) check whether the vol is created on local ec2,
docker volume ls    
#Docker Compose automatically prefixes volume names with your directory name to avoid conflicts, so it will likely look like YOURFOLDERNAME_<volname>

docker volume inspect YOURFOLDERNAME_<volname>
